#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:2
msgid "Support Bundles"
msgstr "Support-Pakete"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:4
msgid ""
"Support bundles collect diagnostic information from the |morpheus| "
"appliance and managed infrastructure to assist with troubleshooting and "
"support case resolution. Bundles are generated on-demand or automatically"
" and can be downloaded locally or delivered directly to HPE Support."
msgstr ""
"Support-Pakete sammeln Diagnoseinformationen von der |morpheus|-Appliance "
"und der verwalteten Infrastruktur, um bei der Fehlerbehebung und der "
"Lösung von Support-Fällen zu unterstützen. Pakete werden bei Bedarf oder "
"automatisch generiert und können lokal heruntergeladen oder direkt an den "
"HPE Support übermittelt werden."

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:6
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Administration --> Health --> Support "
"Bundles` to view, generate, download, or delete support bundles."
msgstr ""
"Navigieren Sie zu :menuselection:`Administration --> Health --> Support "
"Bundles`, um Support-Pakete anzuzeigen, zu generieren, herunterzuladen "
"oder zu löschen."

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:8
#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:46
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Hinweis"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:8
msgid ""
"Support bundles are available only to master tenant users with System "
"Admin role. The ``Admin: Support Bundles`` permission gates read and full"
" access."
msgstr ""
"Support-Pakete stehen nur Master-Tenant-Benutzern mit der Rolle System "
"Admin zur Verfügung. Die Berechtigung ``Admin: Support Bundles`` steuert "
"den Lese- und Vollzugriff."

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:11
msgid "Generating a Support Bundle"
msgstr "Ein Support-Paket generieren"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:13
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Administration --> Health --> Support "
"Bundles`."
msgstr ""
"Navigieren Sie zu :menuselection:`Administration --> Health --> Support "
"Bundles`."

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:14
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Generate New Support Bundle`."
msgstr "Klicken Sie auf :guilabel:`Generate New Support Bundle`."

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:15
msgid "Enter a :guilabel:`Name` for the bundle."
msgstr "Geben Sie einen :guilabel:`Name` für das Paket ein."

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:16
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Log Range Start` and :guilabel:`Log Range End` to "
"define the time window for log collection."
msgstr ""
"Legen Sie :guilabel:`Log Range Start` und :guilabel:`Log Range End` fest, "
"um das Zeitfenster für die Protokollsammlung zu definieren."

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:17
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Components` section, select one or more categories and "
"content types to include. Resource-backed content types allow selecting "
"specific resources (for example, a specific cloud or storage server)."
msgstr ""
"Wählen Sie im Abschnitt :guilabel:`Components` eine oder mehrere Kategorien "
"und Inhaltstypen aus. Ressourcengestützte Inhaltstypen ermöglichen die "
"Auswahl bestimmter Ressourcen (z. B. eine bestimmte Cloud oder einen "
"Speicher-Server)."

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:18
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Generate`."
msgstr "Klicken Sie auf :guilabel:`Generate`."

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:20
msgid ""
"The bundle is created asynchronously. Status progresses from **Pending** "
"through **In Progress** to **Completed** or **Failed**. Large bundles may"
" take several minutes depending on the number of components and log "
"volume. An in-progress bundle can be cancelled from the list page."
msgstr ""
"Das Paket wird asynchron erstellt. Der Status verläuft von **Pending** "
"über **In Progress** zu **Completed** oder **Failed**. Große Pakete können "
"je nach Anzahl der Komponenten und Protokollvolumen mehrere Minuten "
"dauern. Ein laufendes Paket kann von der Listenseite abgebrochen werden."

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:23
msgid "Bundle Content Categories"
msgstr "Paketinhaltskategorien"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:29
msgid "Category"
msgstr "Kategorie"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:30
msgid "Contents"
msgstr "Inhalte"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:31
msgid "Appliance"
msgstr "Appliance"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:32
msgid ""
"Application logs (morpheus-ui, check-server, guacd, mysql, nginx, "
"opensearch), appliance configuration (sanitized), health metrics (CPU, "
"memory, storage, database, elastic, queues, threads), system information "
"(OS, kernel, hardware, network)"
msgstr ""
"Anwendungsprotokolle (morpheus-ui, check-server, guacd, mysql, nginx, "
"opensearch), Appliance-Konfiguration (bereinigt), Gesundheitsmetriken (CPU, "
"Speicher, Festplattenspeicher, Datenbank, Elastic, Warteschlangen, Threads), "
"Systeminformationen (OS, Kernel, Hardware, Netzwerk)"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:33
msgid "Clouds"
msgstr "Clouds"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:34
msgid "Cloud integration diagnostics for selected clouds"
msgstr "Cloud-Integrationsdiagnose für ausgewählte Clouds"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:35
msgid "Clusters"
msgstr "Cluster"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:36
msgid ""
"HVM cluster health, host status, quorum state, and cluster-level "
"diagnostics"
msgstr ""
"HVM-Cluster-Gesundheit, Host-Status, Quorum-Status und Diagnose auf "
"Cluster-Ebene"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:37
msgid "Networking"
msgstr "Netzwerk"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:38
msgid ""
"Network server diagnostics (including Aruba CX switch bundle when "
"configured)"
msgstr ""
"Netzwerk-Server-Diagnose (einschließlich Aruba CX Switch-Paket, wenn "
"konfiguriert)"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:39
msgid "Servers"
msgstr "Server"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:40
msgid "Compute server diagnostics for selected managed servers"
msgstr "Compute-Server-Diagnose für ausgewählte verwaltete Server"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:41
msgid "Storage"
msgstr "Speicher"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:42
msgid ""
"Storage server diagnostics. For HPE Alletra MP storage servers: triggers "
"telemetry bundle generation on the array. If call-home is not enabled, "
"downloads the resulting bundle; if call-home is enabled, triggers "
"generation only (data already sent separately)"
msgstr ""
"Speicher-Server-Diagnose. Für HPE Alletra MP Speicher-Server: löst die "
"Telemetrie-Paketgenerierung auf dem Array aus. Wenn Call-Home nicht "
"aktiviert ist, wird das resultierende Paket heruntergeladen; wenn Call-Home "
"aktiviert ist, wird nur die Generierung ausgelöst (Daten werden bereits "
"separat gesendet)"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:44
msgid ""
"Each category can expose multiple content types. Resource-backed content "
"types allow selecting specific instances of that resource (for example, a"
" particular storage server or cloud integration). A failure collecting "
"one component does not block the overall bundle."
msgstr ""
"Jede Kategorie kann mehrere Inhaltstypen bereitstellen. Ressourcengestützte "
"Inhaltstypen ermöglichen die Auswahl bestimmter Instanzen dieser Ressource "
"(z. B. ein bestimmter Speicher-Server oder eine Cloud-Integration). Ein "
"Fehler beim Sammeln einer Komponente blockiert nicht das gesamte Paket."

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:46
msgid ""
"Support bundles never include customer VM data, stored credentials (these"
" are encrypted at rest), or tenant-specific business data. Only "
"infrastructure diagnostic information is collected."
msgstr ""
"Support-Pakete enthalten niemals Kunden-VM-Daten, gespeicherte "
"Anmeldeinformationen (diese sind im Ruhezustand verschlüsselt) oder "
"mandantenspezifische Geschäftsdaten. Es werden nur infrastrukturelle "
"Diagnoseinformationen gesammelt."

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:49
msgid "Health Metrics Included"
msgstr "Enthaltene Gesundheitsmetriken"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:51
msgid "The health summary collected in the bundle includes:"
msgstr "Die im Paket gesammelte Gesundheitszusammenfassung umfasst:"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:53
msgid ""
"**CPU:** Processor count, process uptime, Morpheus CPU usage, system CPU "
"usage, system load average"
msgstr ""
"**CPU:** Prozessoranzahl, Prozesslaufzeit, Morpheus-CPU-Auslastung, "
"System-CPU-Auslastung, durchschnittliche Systemlast"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:54
msgid ""
"**Memory:** Morpheus memory (total, used, free, usage %), system memory, "
"swap"
msgstr ""
"**Memory:** Morpheus-Speicher (gesamt, belegt, frei, Auslastung %), "
"Systemspeicher, Swap"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:55
msgid ""
"**Storage:** Filesystem details (used, free, total, percent utilization, "
"mount points)"
msgstr ""
"**Storage:** Dateisystemdetails (belegt, frei, gesamt, prozentuale "
"Auslastung, Einhängepunkte)"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:56
msgid ""
"**Database (MySQL):** Version, connection statistics, thread statistics, "
"performance metrics (slow queries, temp tables), InnoDB statistics"
msgstr ""
"**Database (MySQL):** Version, Verbindungsstatistiken, Thread-Statistiken, "
"Leistungsmetriken (langsame Abfragen, temporäre Tabellen), InnoDB-Statistiken"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:57
msgid ""
"**OpenSearch:** Cluster status, node count, shard information, per-node "
"heap/memory/CPU, index health"
msgstr ""
"**OpenSearch:** Cluster-Status, Knotenanzahl, Shard-Informationen, "
"Heap/Speicher/CPU pro Knoten, Index-Gesundheit"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:58
msgid ""
"**Queues (RabbitMQ):** Queue count, busy/error queues, per-queue message "
"counts"
msgstr ""
"**Queues (RabbitMQ):** Warteschlangenanzahl, ausgelastete/fehlerhafte "
"Warteschlangen, Nachrichtenanzahl pro Warteschlange"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:59
msgid "**Threads:** Total count, busy, running, blocked, per-thread details"
msgstr "**Threads:** Gesamtanzahl, ausgelastet, laufend, blockiert, Details pro Thread"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:61
msgid "This health data is written as a JSON file within the support bundle."
msgstr "Diese Gesundheitsdaten werden als JSON-Datei im Support-Paket gespeichert."

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:64
msgid "HPE Support Integration"
msgstr "HPE Support-Integration"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:66
msgid ""
"Configure HPE Support integration at :menuselection:`Administration --> "
"Settings --> Support`."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurieren Sie die HPE Support-Integration unter "
":menuselection:`Administration --> Settings --> Support`."

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:72
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "Einstellung"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:73
#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:115
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Beschreibung"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:74
msgid "Daily Support Bundle"
msgstr "Tägliches Support-Paket"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:75
msgid ""
"When enabled, automatically generates a support bundle once daily and "
"delivers it to HPE Support"
msgstr ""
"Wenn aktiviert, wird automatisch einmal täglich ein Support-Paket generiert "
"und an den HPE Support übermittelt"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:76
msgid "Send to HPE"
msgstr "An HPE senden"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:77
msgid ""
"When enabled, completed bundles are converted to CMB format and delivered"
" to HPE via the RDA (Remote Data Access) agent"
msgstr ""
"Wenn aktiviert, werden abgeschlossene Pakete in das CMB-Format konvertiert "
"und über den RDA-Agenten (Remote Data Access) an HPE übermittelt"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:78
msgid "Remote Support Access"
msgstr "Remote-Support-Zugriff"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:79
msgid ""
"Enables HPE Support remote access to the appliance for diagnostics "
"(requires Send to HPE enabled)"
msgstr ""
"Aktiviert den HPE Support-Fernzugriff auf die Appliance für Diagnosen "
"(erfordert aktiviertes „An HPE senden")"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:80
msgid "Default Storage Bucket"
msgstr "Standard-Speicher-Bucket"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:81
msgid "Select the storage bucket where bundles are archived"
msgstr "Wählen Sie den Speicher-Bucket, in dem Pakete archiviert werden"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:83
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Appliance Nodes` table on the Support settings page shows "
"each node's hostname, RDA connection status (connected, disconnected, or "
"not configured), and **Station ID**. The Station ID uniquely identifies "
"the appliance to HPE Support."
msgstr ""
"Die Tabelle :guilabel:`Appliance Nodes` auf der Support-Einstellungsseite "
"zeigt den Hostnamen jedes Knotens, den RDA-Verbindungsstatus (verbunden, "
"getrennt oder nicht konfiguriert) und die **Station ID**. Die Station ID "
"identifiziert die Appliance eindeutig gegenüber dem HPE Support."

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:85
msgid "When **Send to HPE** is enabled:"
msgstr "Wenn **An HPE senden** aktiviert ist:"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:87
msgid ""
"Completed bundles are packaged and pushed to the local RDA agent for "
"delivery"
msgstr ""
"Abgeschlossene Pakete werden verpackt und an den lokalen RDA-Agenten zur "
"Zustellung übertragen"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:88
msgid ""
"Delivery status is tracked per bundle: In Progress, Delivered, Failed, or"
" Superseded"
msgstr ""
"Der Zustellungsstatus wird pro Paket verfolgt: In Progress, Delivered, "
"Failed oder Superseded"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:89
msgid ""
"The list and detail views show delivery status when HPE delivery is "
"enabled"
msgstr ""
"Die Listen- und Detailansichten zeigen den Zustellungsstatus an, wenn die "
"HPE-Zustellung aktiviert ist"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:91
msgid ""
"When **Send to HPE** is disabled, bundles remain on the appliance for "
"manual download and submission to support."
msgstr ""
"Wenn **An HPE senden** deaktiviert ist, verbleiben die Pakete auf der "
"Appliance zum manuellen Herunterladen und Einreichen beim Support."

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:94
msgid "Managing Support Bundles"
msgstr "Support-Pakete verwalten"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:96
msgid ""
"Previously-generated bundles are listed on the Support Bundles tab with "
"columns for Name, Status, Started At, Completed At, Size, and Log Range. "
"From each bundle's actions:"
msgstr ""
"Zuvor generierte Pakete werden auf der Registerkarte Support Bundles mit "
"Spalten für Name, Status, Started At, Completed At, Size und Log Range "
"aufgelistet. Über die Aktionen jedes Pakets:"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:98
msgid "**Download** — Download the bundle archive to your local machine"
msgstr "**Download** — Laden Sie das Paketarchiv auf Ihren lokalen Computer herunter"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:99
msgid "**Delete** — Remove the bundle from the appliance"
msgstr "**Delete** — Entfernen Sie das Paket von der Appliance"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:100
msgid "**Cancel** — Stop an in-progress bundle generation"
msgstr "**Cancel** — Stoppen Sie eine laufende Paketgenerierung"

#: ../../administration/supportability/support_bundles.rst:102
msgid ""
"Support bundles are stored on the appliance filesystem. In space-"
"constrained environments, delete old bundles after they have been "
"submitted to support."
msgstr ""
"Support-Pakete werden im Dateisystem der Appliance gespeichert. In "
"speicherplatzbeschränkten Umgebungen sollten alte Pakete gelöscht werden, "
"nachdem sie an den Support übermittelt wurden."

